  "body": "### Describe the feature you'd like to request\n\nI'd like to request that insted of Homarr query the status every 5 seconds to update the data it is stored.\nUser activity log of emby is just me every 5 seconds, so hard to keep track.\nIt also affects the logs of emby with user connect stuff every 5 seconds.\n\nIs it possible to store the user authentication or what to call it instead so it's not checked every 5 seconds?\n\nRequested by @gitstabs but he was somehow unable to create issues\n\n### Additional information\n\nUse the existing sessionStore for this (don't forget invalidating when changing the credentials)",
